WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.394 --> 00:00:03.409
填写本次可见的成功请求 / Enter the visible success example

2
00:00:03.409 --> 00:00:06.492
真实Send并核对成功响应 / Actually Send and verify the successful response

3
00:00:06.492 --> 00:00:09.508
填写本轮会关闭连接的自有端点 / Enter the owned endpoint that closes its connection

4
00:00:09.508 --> 00:00:12.536
观察真实网络失败 / Observe the real network failure

5
00:00:12.536 --> 00:00:15.664
打开自有PAC失败示例 / Open the owned PAC failure example

6
00:00:15.664 --> 00:00:18.719
选择PAC草稿 / Choose a PAC draft

7
00:00:18.719 --> 00:00:21.729
填写本轮返回404的PAC地址 / Enter the owned PAC URL that returns 404

8
00:00:21.729 --> 00:00:24.868
Apply实际失败并保持原路线 / Observe actual Apply failure while retaining the route

9
00:00:24.868 --> 00:00:27.901
Discard失败草稿不改原配置 / Discard the failed draft without changing saved configuration

10
00:00:27.901 --> 00:00:43.163
进入Diagnostics / Open Diagnostics

11
00:00:43.163 --> 00:00:47.649
先导出当前记录留证据 / Export current records before filtering

12
00:00:47.649 --> 00:00:50.649
核对产品导出的真实结果分类 / Inspect the actual exported outcome classifications

13
00:00:50.649 --> 00:00:53.798
按core进程筛选 / Filter by core process

14
00:00:53.798 --> 00:00:56.869
切到失败操作所属main进程 / Switch to the failed action’s main process

15
00:00:56.869 --> 00:00:59.908
按error级别筛选 / Filter by error level

16
00:00:59.908 --> 00:01:02.921
查看success结果组合 / Inspect the success outcome combination

17
00:01:02.921 --> 00:01:05.945
切到failed结果 / Switch to failed outcomes

18
00:01:05.945 --> 00:01:08.993
选择真正失败的上游操作 / Select the actually failed upstream action

19
00:01:08.993 --> 00:01:11.977
读取自动展示的关联时间线 / Read the automatically shown related timeline

20
00:01:11.977 --> 00:01:15.497
拖动Diagnostics分栏 / Drag the Diagnostics splitter

21
00:01:15.497 --> 00:01:18.532
切换Level至warn / Cycle Level to warn

22
00:01:18.532 --> 00:01:21.568
切换Level至info / Cycle Level to info

23
00:01:21.568 --> 00:01:24.599
切换Level至debug / Cycle Level to debug

24
00:01:24.599 --> 00:01:27.627
切换Level至all / Cycle Level to all

25
00:01:27.627 --> 00:01:30.640
切换Outcome至cancelled / Cycle Outcome to cancelled

26
00:01:30.640 --> 00:01:33.657
切换Outcome至timed_out / Cycle Outcome to timed_out

27
00:01:33.657 --> 00:01:36.677
切换Outcome至all / Cycle Outcome to all

28
00:01:36.677 --> 00:01:39.701
切换Process至renderer / Cycle Process to renderer

29
00:01:39.701 --> 00:01:42.732
切换Process至all / Cycle Process to all

30
00:01:42.732 --> 00:01:45.821
确认三个筛选全部清除 / Verify all three filters are cleared

31
00:01:45.821 --> 00:01:49.118
加载实际历史页 / Load the actual earlier page

32
00:01:49.118 --> 00:02:02.469
滚动真实历史列表 / Scroll the real history list

33
00:02:02.469 --> 00:02:06.942
保存本次Diagnostics JSONL / Save this Diagnostics JSONL

34
00:02:06.942 --> 00:02:09.945
核对实际导出而不是只看弹窗 / Verify the actual export, not just the dialog

35
00:02:09.945 --> 00:02:13.053
返回产生记录的Composer / Return to Composer, which produced the records

36
00:02:13.053 --> 00:02:16.067
改回可工作的自有服务 / Return to the working owned service

37
00:02:16.067 --> 00:02:19.595
再次Send核对真实业务恢复 / Send again and verify actual recovery
